__How the backend Connects__
Frontend sends JSON  →  validated against a Schema
                              ↓
                    Router calls a CRUD function
                              ↓
              CRUD function uses the Model to build a query
                              ↓
                     Postgres actually runs it
                              ↓
              Result comes back as a Model object
                              ↓
                  Converted back into a Schema (response)
                              ↓
                    Sent to frontend as JSON
